{"ref":"BDB, צַמֶּ֫רֶת","hw":"צַמֶּ֫רֶת","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">צַמֶּ֫רֶת</span></big>  <strong>n.f. tree-top (</strong>poss. from <em>woolly</em>, feathery, appearance<strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">צ׳</span> cstr., of cedar (in fig.) <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 17:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.17.3\">Ez 17:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 17:22\" href=\"/Ezekiel.17.22\">22</a>, so sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">צַמַּרְתּוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.3\">31:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.10\">10</a>; of tall trees in gen., <span dir=\"rtl\">צַמַּרְתָּם</span> v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.14\">14</a>.","next":"BDB, צְמָרִי","prev":"BDB, צֶ֫מֶר"}